WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:05.588
No way…

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:07.465
Master Yoh.

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.509
It's still too early, is it not?

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:13.722
No. I've had plenty of sleep.

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:15.765
Anyways,

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:19.602
it's been a while since we've
taken a stroll, just the two of us.

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:23.189
I remember this feeling.

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:25.191
A fresh, crisp morning like this…

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:27.944
I haven't enjoyed one
since we were in Funbari Hill.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:29.362
Right.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.199
It all ends today, huh?

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:38.371
Funny, isn't it? All I wanted
was to have it easy,

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:40.123
and look where I am now.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:42.792
Amidamaru.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.211
Thanks for everything, really.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.631
Where has all this come from?

00:00:48.673 --> 00:00:51.217
-The time for thanks is--
-It's not too early.

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:57.640
After all, becoming Shaman King
means dying.

00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:02.228
Hao is presently in the sleep of death,

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:04.355
waiting for the time
he becomes Shaman King.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:09.986
Once he's the Shaman King, I'm not going
to get out of a fight with him unscathed.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.113
Master Yoh…

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:13.656
But then, Ms. Anna…

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.116
Come on!

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:17.952
She's long since been ready for this.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.706
Everyone dies, sooner or later.

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:25.668
That's why we don't live
to live a long life.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.670
We live to die properly.

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:30.673
Amidamaru.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:34.135
Today will be the true final battle.

00:01:35.011 --> 00:01:36.846
Once again, I'm counting on you.

00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:41.142
As you wish!

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:44.270
Oh, boy.

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:47.565
I thought you'd vanished on us,
but here you are.

00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:53.154
We were sure you'd run off to Hao
on your lonesome again.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.865
Oh, you guys are all up early.

00:01:55.907 --> 00:01:57.117
Of course.

00:01:57.158 --> 00:01:59.869
Early bird gets the worm.

00:01:59.911 --> 00:02:01.871
Good morning, Yoh!

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:03.581
Looks like another fine day!

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:06.751
We're all back in fighting shape!

00:02:06.876 --> 00:02:09.337
We'll have to thank Kalim.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:12.132
He even baked us some bread!

00:02:12.173 --> 00:02:14.134
Come on, let's all
have breakfast together!

00:02:15.051 --> 00:02:16.177
Sure!

